{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"The mcp service in `infra/compose/docker-compose.yml` does not set `REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL`.\nOn a fresh deploy the container crash-loops before serving: `AuthSettings` (pydantic) raises a\nValidationError because `issuer_url` is empty (`src/rebar/mcp_server.py` ~L609,\n`AuthSettings(issuer_url=mcp_cfg.auth_issuer_url, ...)`), and `/health` never comes up.\n\n## Root cause (surfaced by jackal live deploy)\nThe compose mcp `environment:` block sets `REBAR_MCP_AUTH_RESOURCE_SERVER_URL` (compose ~L347)\nbut omits the sibling `REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL`. `fetch-secrets.sh` does not inject it either,\nso the container boots with an empty issuer URL and fails auth-settings construction.\n\n## Live impact\nOn the prod box the endpoint only came up after a temporary `.env` hotfix appending\n`REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL=https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/mcp`. Autodeploy rsync from main\nwill drop that hotfix and can re-crash the mcp container on the next blue-green tick.\n\n## Fix\nAdd to the mcp `environment:` block, mirroring how RESOURCE_SERVER_URL is set:\n`REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL: \"${REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL:-https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/mcp}\"`\n\n## RED-first oracle\nA compose-assertion test that parses docker-compose.yml and asserts the mcp service environment\ndefines a non-empty `REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL` (fails today, passes after the fix). Note:\n`tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_auth.py` always sets `auth_issuer_url` explicitly, so unit\ntests never caught the compose omission — the gap is deploy config, not the auth code.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] RED compose-assertion test proves the mcp service env omits a non-empty issuer URL, then passes after the fix.\n- [x] docker-compose.yml mcp environment sets REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL (default to the prod /mcp URL, overridable).\n- [x] [operator-attested] Lands via Gerrit (LLM-Review +1 AND Verified +1). Change 2222 merged (799ba486196f); both votes +1."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1787691310300925001,"uuid":"fd3dacef-4e64-4cc5-9704-9fbaa6c096b9"}